    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dStory\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuto Fujimoto is a shut-in with a knack for computers and an unhealthy obsession with idols. When Facibook offers him a job censoring adult content, he takes it reluctantly, spending his days scrubbing images that violate community guidelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the work is mind-numbing. However, as the flagged posts pile up, Yuto starts noticing something strange. Behind the filters and file names lie hidden connections to three women in his life: Misa, the married apartment manager. Yui, his favorite idol. And Rika, the pious nun at the local church. All of them are harboring secrets he never expected to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a mundane job takes a wild turn when Yuto mistakenly lets adult content slip past moderation. The strange reactions from his neighbors and the media suggest something's changed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/e21e7cbe1f214a6fd6381c57671a336e.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dGame Overview\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is split into four time slots, giving you time to earn money, rise through the ranks, and explore the city while deepening your connections with NPCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/1196ec8bc67a432e236e8c9c910dc77d.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll progress through five ranks, from Intern to Manager, unlocking better pay and greater freedom with each promotion. With that freedom comes opportunity: once you\u2019ve proven yourself, you can start making \u201cmistakes\u201d on purpose, letting explicit content slip through to quietly raise the world\u2019s CHAOS level without getting fired for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world slips deeper into chaos, the NPCs begin to behave in unexpected and perverse ways. Dialogue shifts, outfits change, and new lewd events are unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/f12413e5e08f09e42a28e213f8b33b1b.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer Misa Hashimoto\u2019s route to buy a bus card at the convenience store. This opens up the Church, Convention, and Police Station\u2014each packed with new content and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/b860871737624ebe1cbf38eb646af2b7.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7887a0ca814e5921af6499dc4ce3d299.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8a67856c4a760d33d59ea0ecdbfa54d0.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newest update includes all DLC, featuring a fresh new target of desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dGame Play\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day consists of four periods\u2014Morning, Afternoon, Evening and Night. Plan your schedule wisely to boost relationships, earn cash, and uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find opportunities to get closer to the heroine. Rank up as a censor and keep driving the world further into chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique missions and mini-games await at both the Church and the Convention. Engage in confessionals, sing hymns, or dive into the more depraved side of religious devotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.poster.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.webm?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.mp4?t=1754918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dCharacters\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/66dba37b2326df77eeb8ac5763517ab4.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dFeatures\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfOver a dozen mini-games and side missions bring extra layers to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfEnjoy 60+ pixel-art erotic animations and more than 200 CG variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfThree major zones and over 30 unique NPCs await. Most female NPCs are fair game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfExpect surprise cameos from Chiho, Lilith from NTRaholic and other beloved characters from games publishing by Mango Party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/0a4d77cad5290d58c22693abdcf23e35.avif?t=1754918961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bCharacters and visuals borrowed from other titles are all officially licensed and approved.</p>",
